# Deployment build (deploy/azure/deploy-azure.ps1) runs `az acr build` with
# the REPO ROOT as context, but this repo also carries years of docs,
# .git history, node_modules-style caches, and .env -- none of which should
# ever be uploaded to a remote build service. Allowlist only what the image
# actually needs.
*

!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!cato/
!cato/**
!deploy/
!deploy/azure/
!deploy/azure/Dockerfile
!deploy/azure/entrypoint.py
!deploy/azure/container-config.template.yaml
!deploy/azure/.build-context/
!deploy/azure/.build-context/**

# Never include these even if a broader rule above would otherwise catch them.
# Anchored to repo root so they do NOT shadow the intentionally-staged
# deploy/azure/.build-context/vault.enc copy allowlisted above.
/.env
/.env.*
/vault.enc
*.dpapi
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
